    "propertyName": "SpicyMango CanvaSand ",
    "propertyType": "HOTEL",
    "description": "**CanvaSand by Spicy Mango** is a chic coastal retreat designed for relaxation and luxury. Situated along a pristine beach, this resort combines modern design with natural beauty, offering guests an idyllic escape from the everyday. The property features a range of beautifully appointed rooms and villas with panoramic ocean views, where guests can unwind to the sound of the waves.\n\nWith an emphasis on sustainability and comfort, CanvaSand boasts eco-friendly accommodations, a beachfront restaurant offering fresh seafood and local delicacies, and a wellness center for rejuvenation. Guests can indulge in a variety of water sports, take long beach walks, or enjoy private beach dinners.\n\nThe resort’s serene ambiance, paired with attentive service, makes it the perfect destination for couples, families, or solo travelers looking for a peaceful retreat. Whether for a romantic getaway or a family vacation, CanvaSand by Spicy Mango promises an unforgettable and luxurious experience by the sea.",
